   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Documentary warm look: soft capped highlights (~220), warm brown shadows, medium saturation, olive greens. Skin creamy-warm and slightly muted. Best for: Candid / documentary frames, pheras and rituals in mixed light, emotional moments, haldi and mehendi in daylight. Works on both bright and dim frames because highlights are protected.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
